flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6951775Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6952770Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6953254Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6953825Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6955605Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6956035Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6956317Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6958116Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6958872Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6959592Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6960701Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6961725Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6962407Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6962748Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6963114Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6963615Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6964012Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6964760Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6965010Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6965220Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6965539Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6965939Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
