flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6967340Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6967729Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6968003Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6968522Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6968990Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6969771Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6970367Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6970881Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:54:05.6971497Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
